@startuml
' fitbit - Raspberry Pi - EC2 사용자 흐름 (code 기준: fitbitOAuth, edge, tokenFetcher, producer)
' 미리보기: !theme, ** , 색# 지양

title Fitbit, Raspberry Pi, EC2 — 사용자/데이터 흐름

actor 사용자 as u
participant "브라우저" as br
participant "EC2: nginx" as ng
participant "EC2: Next" as next
participant "EC2: api-server" as api
database "EC2: MySQL" as db
boundary "Fitbit (OAuth/웹)" as fitb

queue "EC2: Kafka" as kfk
boundary "Raspberry Pi\nedge-agent" as rpi
participant "Fitbit\nREST API" as fitbapi

== 1) 웹: 가입, 로그인, Fitbit 1회 연동 ==
u -> br : 대시보드 방문(HTTPS)
br -> ng
ng -> next
u -> br : 가입, 로그인(토큰 저장)
br -> ng
ng -> api : /auth, /auth/fitbit/start (Bearer JWT)
api -> br : OAuth authorize_url
br -> u : Fitbit로 이동(리다이렉트)
u -> fitb : 계정로그인, 권한 승인
fitb -> ng : /auth/fitbit/callback (쿼리)
ng -> api
api -> db : access_token, refresh (fitbit_tokens)
api -> br : Location: .../dashboard?fitbit=connected

== 2) (선택) 엣지 등록 — Pi 마다 device, API 키 ==
rpi -> api : POST /api/edge/register (또는 시드/관리흐름)
api -> db : edge_devices, api_key_hash
api -> rpi : api_key (1회, .env에 기록)

== 3) 런타임: Pi, Kafka, API ==
note over rpi,db
  Pi .env: KAFKA_BROKERS=EC2:9094, EC2_API_BASE(HTTPS), EDGE_API_KEY, USER_ID(=웹로그인 유저), MOCK_*=false(실기)
end note

rpi -> kfk : WBGT, heart rate(토픽) — kafkajs
rpi -> api : X-Edge-Api-Key + GET /api/edge/fitbit-token/USER_ID
api -> db : user Fitbit token(refresh)
api -> rpi : access_token(짧은 유효)
rpi -> fitbapi : 심박/활동 조회(폴링)
rpi -> api : POST /api/edge/heartbeat(주기)

kfk -> api : consumer가 메시지 처리(세션, 캐시, 리스크 등, 서버내부)

@enduml
